# An update sits behind the browser cache until the service worker and the
# manifest are refetched, so they are never served stale. Hashed assets never
# change, so a year is safe.
#
# The policy names both Clerk instances because preview and development builds
# sign in against clerk.accounts.dev while production uses clerk.crosstune.app.
# The script hash covers the inline theme script in index.html; headers.test.ts
# fails when the two drift. The pitch stage's AudioWorklet loads from a blob:
# URL and compiles WebAssembly, and worklets follow script-src, not
# worker-src. Recordings play from blob: URLs and move to and from R2 by fetch.
# Slippery-Hill files play in an audio element from their own origin, so media-src
# names it. Analytics goes to the first-party relay, which needs connect-src and
# nothing else: the recorder builds its compression worker from a blob: URL, which
# worker-src already allows.
# Purchases: RevenueCat's Web SDK loads Stripe's script, frames Stripe's checkout,
# reaches RevenueCat and Stripe by fetch, and draws the app's checkout branding and
# font from RevenueCat's CloudFront host. Payment is allowed only to Stripe's frames,
# which offer Apple Pay and Google Pay.
# Deleting an account with an Apple connection loads Apple's sign-in script, whose popup is
# its own window and answers by postMessage, so frame-src stays as it is and no
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy may cut the popup off from its opener.
# The location page's map and Nearby search load MapKit JS from cdn.apple-mapkit.com, which
# fetches map tiles, services, and snapshot images from numbered hosts under apple-mapkit.com
# and runs a worker from blob:, as Apple's content-security-policy guidance lists.
# The app is behind sign-in, so no response belongs in search results.
# HSTS is a zone setting, not a header here.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-ATudCxqw6nWWgYgE5+Qrq1RZ0+lGV15Js4/4NOcvMCY=' blob: 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://clerk.crosstune.app https://*.clerk.accounts.dev https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.protect.clerk.com https://js.stripe.com https://*.js.stripe.com https://appleid.cdn-apple.com https://cdn.apple-mapkit.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://*.apple-mapkit.com https://img.clerk.com https://*.stripe.com https://da08ctfrofx1b.cloudfront.net; font-src 'self' https://da08ctfrofx1b.cloudfront.net; media-src 'self' blob: https://www.slippery-hill.com; worker-src 'self' blob: https://*.apple-mapkit.com; connect-src 'self' blob: https://*.apple-mapkit.com https://clerk.crosstune.app https://*.clerk.accounts.dev https://*.protect.clerk.com:* https://clerk-telemetry.com https://*.r2.cloudflarestorage.com https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io https://relay.crosstune.app https://api.revenuecat.com https://e.revenue.cat https://api.stripe.com https://checkout.stripe.com; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://open.spotify.com https://embed.music.apple.com https://embed.tidal.com https://w.soundcloud.com https://bandcamp.com https://archive.org https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.protect.clerk.com https://js.stripe.com https://*.js.stripe.com https://hooks.stripe.com https://checkout.stripe.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(self), payment=("https://js.stripe.com" "https://*.js.stripe.com" "https://checkout.stripe.com"), usb=()
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets/*
